/// <summary>
/// The hearth window's forecast for tonight (2026.08.16, Anton: "85% plainly AND 85% with the
/// best gift" read as a broken multiplier). It is not broken — on the peak nights of a fertile
/// young wife the PLAIN reckoning already stands near certainty, and
